  "description": "Consists of 3 short stories.\n\n**Order:** \n\n**1) Young Forever** (13 Chapters) \n\nAn ancient vampire and a college jock get together by accident, but can they make it work?\n\n**2. Sugar Farm** (6 Chapters) \n\nJin is on vacation when his boss asks him to carry out some job errands, which leads to an exhilarating escapade on a sugar cane farm in Central America.\n\n**3. Start Over** (4 Chapters)\n\nOne is head over heels. The other is completely dispassionate. But as they say, you never value something more than when you lose it.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/2404009380), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=11071461), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/euja_short_story?p_id=tw1446), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/euja_short_stories), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000062634), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=240385), Watcha",
